{"id":"nastuplenie","lemma":"наступление","pos":"noun","rank":4584,"glosses":["offensive, onset, advance (an attack)","beginning, coming"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f0/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%83%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D1%83%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"наступления","plural":"наступления"},"examples":[{"text":"Будь дома до наступления темноты, пожалуйста.","en":"Please be home before it gets dark.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"at home"},{"g":"until / before"},null,null,{"g":"please"}]},{"text":"Наступление - лучшая защита.","en":"Attack is the best form of defense.","words":[null,null,{"g":"defense"}]},{"text":"Он приехал туда после наступления темноты.","en":"He arrived there after dark.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to arrive, to come","l":"приехать"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"after"},null,null]},{"text":"Я сделал это до наступления темноты.","en":"I did that until it got dark.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"until / before"},null,null]},{"text":"Ты должен вернуться до наступления темноты.","en":"You must come back before it gets dark.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to return"},{"g":"until / before"},null,null]}]}